{"id":"c6tft7kxmisbjjbhjiowfb0vc","title":"Strive CEO：即使比特币跌至一美分公司也能存活","originalTitle":"Strive CEO：即使比特币“跌到一美分”，公司也能存活","summary":"Strive Inc. CEO Matt Cole表示，即使比特币价格跌至一美分，公司也能存活，因公司没有债务迫使其出售比特币。公司已为比特币下跌80%做好准备，资产负债表上约85%至90%为比特币，足以度过任何熊市。目前公司持有的43,153枚BTC平均购入成本为87,821美元。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"PANews"},"links":{"original":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a1d9b6-66e0-75c0-a3ec-3d1c7236384d"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-14T10:59:35.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-14T11:21:30.668Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-14T11:21:30.668Z","category":"opinion","tags":["合作","比特币"],"score":30,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"5e7b5c34-b5ff-483e-9b0b-1cd45b9310de","title":"Strive CEO称比特币跌至1美分公司仍能存活"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"5e7b5c34-b5ff-483e-9b0b-1cd45b9310de","title":"Strive CEO称比特币跌至1美分公司仍能存活"}],"topics":[{"slug":"crypto-market","name":"行情异动"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fFgUx4j5vG9A","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}